name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q3_2026'

question 'A student asks AI to add an event listener to a button with id `submitBtn`. The AI returns code that uses `document.getElementById("submit-button")`. The button still doesn''t work. Which named AI failure mode best describes what happened?'

right 'Context blindness — AI cannot see the actual page and guessed an id based on patterns from similar pages.'
wrong 'A network outage at the AI service.'
wrong 'A bug in the JavaScript language itself.'
wrong 'The button is broken at the hardware level.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

